    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """The throughline holds [expertise as installable capability rather than remembered information](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_24), framed through [a citable-perspective technical moat](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_26) and [an Apple-not-toolbox platform ambition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_32), with [the expert-as-bottleneck framing](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_30) and [a rhetorical-question market definition](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_28) beneath it. A beta thread tests it live through [a Knowledge Packager classification](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_38) paired with [guidance on plainer post-connector prompting](narr:Position_OnboardingToolPromptGuidance), surfacing [the freeze-after-connect moment](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_58) and [backend concepts experienced as entirely foreign](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63). A third thread turns on identity: [the phone-number tagline flagged incorrect](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_3) against [the channel-not-product correction](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_8), feeding [a named subgraph-scoping and temporality gap](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_36). A fourth thread adds [independent convergent validation from a working designer](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_20) naming [the lens as the irreducible core](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_10), feeding [the design-token/perspective parallel](narr:Position_DesignTokenPerspectiveParallel) and [a brand-as-AI-identity endpoint](narr:Expr_4RealFreyaDesignTokens20260702_13). A fifth thread reframes the moat question from outside: [the telephone-company intermediary thesis](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_109) sits against [the conversational-provenance data model](narr:Position_ConversationalProvenanceDataModel), with [cross-organizational graph federation](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_158) opened as the live question. A sixth thread sharpens market targeting: [finding covert knowledge companies](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_10), [why tech companies resist](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_6), and [the context-fragmentation demand signal](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_8), feeding [a non-tech targeting position](narr:Position_NonTechKnowledgeCompanyTargeting) and [a chaos-containment position](narr:Position_ContextFragmentationContainment). The register across org-lane children runs antithesis-first with analogy and rhetorical-question moves.""" ;
